  "content": "\n\n<h2>FLASHLIGHT+&nbsp;</h2>\n<p><strong>FLASHLIGHT+</strong> 新增了進階的隨身與可佩戴照明工具，以提升您夜間生存與探索的體驗<br>非常適合在黑暗中旅行、探索洞穴或漫步於令人毛骨悚然的廢棄處所<br>設計宗旨在於提供沉浸式照明，同時維持遊戲平衡性</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_8e017f85-5d99-432b-8c5d-680fa320cc2d.png\" width=\"606\" height=\"273\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>照亮您的冒險旅程，從此不再畏懼黑暗</strong></h2>\n<p>此模組新增以下內容：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_93a90baf-2fe9-4979-9717-3d8fe86d68c6.png\" width=\"254\" height=\"53\"></p>\n<p>手電筒<br>投射出跟隨視線移動的定向光束<br>手持電池時右鍵點擊即可充電</p>\n<p>頭燈<br>解放雙手，方便您在夜間採礦與冒險<br>將頭燈與電池一同放入鐵砧進行充電</p>\n<p>提燈<br>可提供持續暖光的照明源，可手持或放置<br>電力耗盡後無法再次充電</p>\n<p>夜視鏡&nbsp;<br>在完全無光的情況下也能清晰視物<br><br></p>\n<p>⚠️&nbsp;<strong>相依模組</strong><br>需要安裝&nbsp;<strong>TCTCore</strong> (V5.2+) <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tct-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載連結</a></p>\n<span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xhJ_YRub4lI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_aaae6a95-296e-4267-9808-c06737fcfa56.png\" width=\"321\" height=\"151\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_76e218ff-5671-4b3b-8dc8-80cccc84e5bd.png\" width=\"321\" height=\"147\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_6c62c656-9836-49e6-8090-1470908408ca.png\" width=\"322\" height=\"152\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_71d435fb-3b53-4111-be28-f4b76c9b4a3e.png\" width=\"322\" height=\"179\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/547224/description_58a55a00-bf87-4c02-b906-37c899d7d8fc.png\" width=\"323\" height=\"150\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
